OL,3,GNEWSAMan who died in house fire named
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man who died in a house fire has been
OL,6,Fnamed as Mark Fawke.
OL,8,FMerseyside Fire and Rescue Service were
OL,9,Fcalled to a semi-detached house on
OL,10,FBeaufort Drive in Wallasey, Wirral,
OL,11,Fjust after 20:30 BST on Monday.
OL,13,FMr Fawke was rescued from the building
OL,14,Fbut pronounced dead by paramedics
OL,15,Fbefore arriving at Arrowe Park
OL,16,FHospital. A dog died at the scene.
OL,18,FFire investigators are working to
OL,19,Festablish the cause of the fire.
